 waves up to 40 foot  wildlife and then there are the marlins  several boats ran into trouble during  the last race  the marlin sphere actually penetrated  the boat  all the way into the internal cabin it's  probably the one thing  yeah the one thing that makes me most  nervous  she's taking this ultimate journey with  three long time friends who will be  relying on each other for survival  hoping they can all come out smiling on  the other side although it's physical  primarily it's a mental challenge so we  need to really understand each other  and know how each other tick so that we  can resolve issues  when we're out at sea  the team is raising money for three  different charities jessica has picked  covenant house  which makes this harrowing crossing  worthwhile it's considered  the hardest row in the world and as  mullen says  the toughest thing she'll ever do in her  life i kite surf  i roll anything on the water so for me  if there was going to be a pinnacle  challenge  climbing everest wasn't going to be it  this is going to be it  this is my challenge and our challenge  for each of us  jay durant global news  and that is global national for this  sunday night i'm robin gill  tonight your canada is a trio of great  grey owls  senior caroline alberta we'd love to see  your corner of this country so please  keep sending your photos to viewers at  globalnational.com  thank you for watching jeff simple will  be at the anchor desk tomorrow i'm on  vacation  for three weeks i'll see you again in  august have a great night
 

